{"id":"b22854791214adbd","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-lob-derivation.md","title":"Löb Derivation","display":"df-lob-derivation — Löb Derivation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-lob-derivation","aliases":["89-df-lob-derivation"],"display":"df-lob-derivation — Löb Derivation","depends_on":["[[89-df-modal-formula]]","[[89-df-box-modality]]","[[89-df-modal-implication]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-lob-derivation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-lob-derivation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-lob-derivation — Löb Derivation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" href=\"?note=56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" title=\"89-df-modal-formula\">89-df-modal-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d246470e97fec132\" href=\"?note=d246470e97fec132\" title=\"89-df-box-modality\">89-df-box-modality</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"32c9990061b9749d\" href=\"?note=32c9990061b9749d\" title=\"89-df-modal-implication\">89-df-modal-implication</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(L\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> is a modal logic.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LobAdm}(L)\">\\(\\mathrm{LobAdm}(L)\\)</span> 是下述定义的一元 Löb 规则可容许性谓词，参数为模态逻辑 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lob\\text{-}derivation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{LobAdm}(L)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\,\n\\bigl((\\Box\\varphi\\to\\varphi)\\in L\n\\Rightarrow\n\\varphi\\in L\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lob\\text{-}derivation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{LobAdm}(L)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\,\n\\bigl((\\Box\\varphi\\to\\varphi)\\in L\n\\Rightarrow\n\\varphi\\in L\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>此谓词表达 Löb 规则的可容许性：若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box\\varphi\\to\\varphi\">\\(\\Box\\varphi\\to\\varphi\\)</span>\n是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-定理，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-定理。</li>\n<li>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L=\\mathrm{GL}\">\\(L=\\mathrm{GL}\\)</span>，正向步骤使用必然化、Löb 公理和 MP；\n可容许性是一个证明论结论，不是 GL 的原始规则。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-modal-formula","status":"resolved","id":"56c1b5b75a32ca1d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-box-modality","status":"resolved","id":"d246470e97fec132","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-box-modality]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-implication","status":"resolved","id":"32c9990061b9749d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-implication]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LobAdm}(L)","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lob\\text{-}derivation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{LobAdm}(L)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\,\n\\bigl((\\Box\\varphi\\to\\varphi)\\in L\n\\Rightarrow\n\\varphi\\in L\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\Box\\varphi\\to\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"L=\\mathrm{GL}","display":false}],"bytes":1026,"backlinks":[{"id":"93f1683ca340f61b","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"类定义给 $\\Box H\\to H$ 可证。对这条定理必然化得 $\\Box(\\Box H\\to H)$，应用 Löb 公理得 $\\Box H$，再用同一蕴含 MP 得 $H$。本证明实际导出 Löb 规则，不把仅定义规则可容许性谓词的 [[89-df-lob-derivation]] 当作规则已经成立的证据。显式参数下的结论与旧固定 $p$ 记号的全称结论相同。"},{"id":"6c54ff0b5f31df9f","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"Löb推导规则 (see [[89-df-lob-derivation]])"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-304","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-lob-derivation]]"}],"outgoing":["56c1b5b75a32ca1d","d246470e97fec132","32c9990061b9749d"]}